# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://dv-flow.github.io/flow.dv.schema.json
package:
  name: hdltest
  desc: HDL test frameworks as dv-flow tasks -- one sub-package per framework
  doc: |
    Each sub-package runs one HDL unit-test framework on top of `hdlsim`: it
    supplies the framework's sources, generates whatever glue the framework's
    own scripts would, and turns the simulation log into an `hdlsim.TestResult`.
    Compiling and running are left to `hdlsim.<sim>.SimImage` and `SimRun`, so
    a framework works on every simulator hdlsim supports, and results roll up
    with `hdlsim.SimSuiteReport` like any other test.

    * `hdltest.svunit` -- SVUnit.
